        "id": 1833664
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-04-17T22:20:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why do we need to filter by min version? I\u0027m not seeing a use case. (i.e. why `--min-version` and not `--max-version`?)\n\nAlso, it\u0027s not clear from the help text if this refers to the hardware info version and aidl version.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 162,
        "startChar": 28,
        "endLine": 162,
        "endChar": 55
      },
      "revId": "3f886c2700eae03153187110a9171ea40bc61851",
