      },
      "lineNbr": 162,
      "author": {
        "id": 1139038
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-04-18T22:13:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027ve added some (untested) lines for pre-v3 HAL impls. At the moment it just returns the protected data but we might want it for package those together like the factory tool does?\n\nIt looks easiest to build the CBOR by hand than figure out a CBOR library to import?",
      "parentUuid": "773b3b35_73145311",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 162,
        "startChar": 28,
        "endLine": 162,
        "endChar": 55
      },
      "revId": "3f886c2700eae03153187110a9171ea40bc61851",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "0228b6c3_6ba43ed5",
        "filename": "services/core/java/com/android/server/security/rkp/RemoteProvisioningService.java",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 162,
      "author": {
        "id": 1833664
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-04-18T23:27:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We\u0027ll need a CBOR library for sure to generate correct output for pre-v3. It\u0027s too complicated to build a \"proper\" CSR otherwise.\n\nThere\u0027s a pretty good java library here: https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/refs/heads/master:external/cbor-java/src/main/java/co/nstant/in/cbor/model/Array.java\n\nIf we want to make a compatible output to the factory extraction tool, then we need to port [`composeCertificateRequestV1`](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:system/security/provisioner/rkp_factory_extraction_lib.cpp;drc\u003d7fc83abf6e5fdfab0c895c9e33363a6d20b0c783;l\u003d109) to java.\n\nI think that\u0027s the right way to go, actually. Because just outputting the protected data as the code does now is insufficient. LMK if you want a hand in porting the code over.",
      "parentUuid": "d9349b8d_6476a4f5",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 162,
        "startChar": 28,
        "endLine": 162,
        "endChar": 55
      },
      "revId": "3f886c2700eae03153187110a9171ea40bc61851",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
