      "writtenOn": "2023-04-17T22:20:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Feels like this should be a helper in `RemoteProvisioningService`:\n\n```\nstatic IRemotelyProvisionedComponent getBinder(String name) {\n    String irpc \u003d irpcInterface + \"/\" + name;\n    IRemotelyProvisionedComponent binder \u003d\n            IRemotelyProvisionedComponent.Stub.asInterface(\n                    ServiceManager.waitForDeclaredService(irpc));\n    if (binder \u003d\u003d null) {\n        throw new IllegalArgumentException(\"failed to find \" + irpc);\n    }\n    return binder;\n}\n```\n\nI think this could be reused at all three call sites where the binders are iterated.",
